          "guid": "mtjb4a39d34gzl41",
          "message": {
            "text": "This is the regression boundary that failed in the demos: a body-propagated canvas background with percentage ellipse radii. The test proves capture ownership, emitted axis geometry, and independent Chromium raster parity; it passed alongside 5,098 repository unit tests.",
            "markdown": "This is the regression boundary that failed in the demos: a body-propagated canvas background with percentage ellipse radii. The test proves capture ownership, emitted axis geometry, and independent Chromium raster parity; it passed alongside 5,098 repository unit tests."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/radial-percentage-ellipse.e2e.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 31,
                  "endLine": 57,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "describeBrowser(\"body-propagated percentage radial gradient (DM-2649)\", () => {\n  it(\"retains Blink's width/height-based ellipse in the captured SVG\", async () => {\n    const context = await env!.browser.newContext({\n      viewport: { width: W, height: H },\n      deviceScaleFactor: 1,\n    });\n    const source = await context.newPage();\n    const generated = await context.newPage();\n    try {\n      await source.setContent(`<!doctype html><style>\n        html{margin:0;background:transparent}\n        body{margin:0;width:${W}px;height:${H}px;background:radial-gradient(120% 130% at 0% 0%,#1d2740 0%,#0b1020 60%)}\n      </style>`);\n      const expected = await source.screenshot();\n      const capture = await captureElementTreeWithWarnings(source, \"body\", {\n        x: 0, y: 0, width: W, height: H,\n      });\n      expect(capture.tree[0]?.styles.backgroundAttachmentGeometry?.canvas?.owner)\n        .toBe(\"body-propagated\");\n      const svg = elementTreeToSvg(capture.tree, W, H);\n      expect(svg).toContain(\"<radialGradient\");\n      expect(svg).toContain('r=\"360\"');\n      expect(svg).toContain('scale(1 0.65)');\n\n      await generated.setContent(`<style>html,body{margin:0}</style>${svg}`);\n      const actual = await generated.screenshot();\n      expect(await meanAbsoluteError(expected, actual)).toBeLessThan(0.35);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
